{"title":"I Regressed As The Duke","synopsis":"Putra Emperor Gline yang agung Pangeran Aaron adalah penerima Dragons Blessing Tetapi karena pemberontakan yang dipimpin oleh pamannya Zerone\nDia dibuang ke pinggiran kerajaan Wilayah Bran\nemperor Zerone akan membunuh kita semua \nLalu semua penduduk di wilayah tersebut dibantai termasuk pelayan Gayle Namun Saat Gayle membuka matanya Gayle mendapati dirinya dalam tubuh Pangeran Aaron yang lebih muda\nAku tidak akan hidup sambil menyembunyikan kekuatanku seperti yang dilakukan Duke\nDengan menggunakan segala cara yang diperlukan untuk mengembangkan wilayahnya dan mempersiapkan invasi Kaisar Zerone yang akan terjadi 20 tahun ke depan dia memutuskan untuk membalaskan dendam pada emperor zerone","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"Golaengji (고랭지), Lee Ha-joo (이하주)","artist":"Choi Bae-geun (최봉근)","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"b7e08980-170d-4fe1-9741-4b09005e7c51","number":"123","title":"Chapter 123","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"c425355a-b0f7-4906-a0d8-1aba8da81d61","number":"122","title":"Chapter 122","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"50b0f671-af42-4802-820d-63aa705cd2b5","number":"121","title":"Chapter 121","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"id":"842fd265-8220-474d-bc8b-d69a1d5aec55","number":"120","title":"Chapter 120","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"7f06619a-ef6b-41c9-9426-63630b53e152","number":"119","title":"Chapter 119","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"id":"3055f69e-557f-4c17-a8fc-4c1a2f2b6f36","number":"118","title":"Chapter 118","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"id":"985da44e-523c-4985-9bf0-47ac88e08327","number":"117","title":"Chapter 117","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"80e28daf-894b-4091-82d4-b2c3f8f135d3","number":"116","title":"Chapter 116","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"114dc20c-4258-4d49-9b27-0d291ad54198","number":"115","title":"Chapter 115","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"a8eaf174-3803-4f3a-b2f3-1286d3a47454","number":